# Navigation order for the subject taxonomy -- see about/our-taxonomy.md.
# Without this, awesome-pages sorts alphabetically and opens the site on
# christian-life, scattering the doctrinal teaching order.
# salvation is defined in the taxonomy but has no content yet; add it here when
# its directory is created.
nav:
  - index.md
  - scripture
  - god
  - jesus
  - biblical-figures
  - spiritual-beings
  - sin
  - israel-and-church
  - last-things
  - feasts
  - christian-life
  - commentaries
  - sermons
  - resources
  # The two interactive tools, mid-migration off Astro.
  #
  # genealogy.md is a real page: the viewer is mounted into it by a React bundle, so mkdocs owns
  # its chrome and `mkdocs serve` renders it like any other page.
  #
  # The timeline is still an Astro page stitched in at deploy time, so it stays a bare Link --
  # site-absolute from the domain ROOT (the site is served at the root of the-way.lewy.au; this
  # carried a '/bible_studies' prefix until 2026-08-23 and 404'd live). Under `mkdocs serve` it
  # 404s regardless, because Astro isn't running there. It becomes a real page in phase 2.
  # Deliberately flat rather than nested under a "Tools" section: the theme's navigation.prune
  # feature renders a section that is never on the active path as one link to its first child,
  # which would have hidden the second tool entirely.
  - Prophetic Timeline: /timeline/
  - genealogy.md
  - about
